OL,3,GNEWSAWhen a wedding fell apart, 11
OL,4,Astrangers helped create something
OL,5,Aunforgettable
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhen her fiance suffered a medical
OL,8,Femergency and their planned elopement
OL,9,Fand relationship fell apart, she could
OL,10,Fhave quietly drawn a line under the
OL,11,Fchapter.
OL,13,FInstead, Bridget Devaney turned to the
OL,14,Finternet with a proposal that sounded
OL,15,Fequal parts hopeful and improbable -
OL,16,Fcome to Northern Ireland and celebrate
OL,17,Fthe wedding that never happened.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
