OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWhen a wedding fell apart, 11
OL,4,Astrangers helped create something
OL,5,Aunforgettable
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhat followed was a story that has
OL,8,Fresonated worldwide as 11 strangers
OL,9,Fanswered the call and helped transform
OL,10,Floss and heartbreak into an
OL,11,Funforgettable week of connection,
OL,12,Fcompanionship and adventure.
OL,14,FFor Bridget and her bevy of
OL,15,F'non-bridesmaids', the experience was a
OL,16,Frefreshing reminder that community is
OL,17,Fall around, "if you want to find it",
OL,18,Fshe said.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
